! GAME~GAMESTATS

Pulls game stats and updates shared game-wide values from the live game prompt.

''Include:'' [[game.ts]]
''Defined at:'' `/include/game.ts:1`

!! Source Excerpt
<pre>
setvar $GAME~DID_GAMESTATS FALSE
if (($PLAYER~STARTINGLOCATION = &quot;0&quot;) OR ($PLAYER~STARTINGLOCATION = &quot;&quot;))
  if (($PLAYER~CURRENT_PROMPT = &quot;Command&quot;) OR ($PLAYER~CURRENT_PROMPT = &quot;Citadel&quot;))
    setvar $PLAYER~STARTINGLOCATION $PLAYER~CURRENT_PROMPT
  end
end
if ($PLAYER~STARTINGLOCATION = &quot;Citadel&quot;)
  send &quot;qqzn&quot;
</pre>

